  "releaseNotes": "6.2.0\n      Read Project Reference for Einvoice\n      6.1.1\n      fix cashrepo check for tcr on constructor\n      6.1.0\n      Get IsRefused from DocumentReference\n      6.0.0\n      Added support for net 8.0\n      5.0.0\n      Add connString\n      4.4.2\n      fix print bleresi ne autofature\n      4.4.0\n      get Invoice Extentions\n      4.3.1\n      Calc invoice lines from invoice total\n      4.3.0\n      Reference Order for Corrective Orders\n      4.2.1\n      Config repo connstr from invoice\n      4.2.0\n      PosInvoiceRepo calc VAT from Price\n      4.1.0\n      add Using Connection to all commands\n      4.0.0\n      Use AbstractClass with GetOpenConnection for readers\n      3.2.0\n      BusinesUnit Get/Set from db with validTo date\n      3.1.0\n      Extend WTN with Warehouse point types, Transaction type, isFlammable and isEscort\n      3.0.1\n      fix yearly counter update based on year\n      3.0.0.\n      Yearly Counter\n      2.7.0\n      Add Taxpoint date\n      2.6.0\n      Get EX reason from POS Items\n      2.5.0\n      add invoiceprofile\n      2.4.0\n      add invoice supply period. Get eInvoiceType\n      2.3.1\n      fix roungind in posinvo for UPB * kursi\n      2.3.0\n      Implement IsExport for PosInvoice. use Reference to MigrationRunner.dll\n      2.2.2.\n      GetCurrentCashBalance implementation\n      2.2.1\n      fixes fatura for resto when no porosi refs\n      2.2.0\n      Adds PaymentDueDate for eInvoiceExt",
